{
  "id": "E277",
  "title": "Chinese Tea Eggs",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-11-25",
  "synopsis": "Fried eggs, scrambled eggs, boiled eggs. Do you know any other ways to serve eggs?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/915/d60c531efeba7babd9d9f4b97e3b211827cec72e.mp3?1542078326",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "茶叶蛋是怎么做的？\n\n保罗：茶叶蛋真好吃！你知道是怎么做的吗？\n小乐：很久以前有一个鸡蛋，它去茶馆喝茶，然后就变成了茶叶蛋。\n保罗：什么？小乐，你是认真的吗？\n小乐：哎呀，保罗，我在开玩笑呢！\n保罗：那你快告诉我茶叶蛋是怎么做的吧。\n小乐：做茶叶蛋很简单，先煮鸡蛋，然后把蛋壳轻轻敲碎，再加一些茶叶和盐一起煮就可以了。\n保罗：好！我回家就试试。",
    "traditional": "茶葉蛋是怎麼做的？\n\n保羅：茶葉蛋真好吃！你知道是怎麼做的嗎？\n小樂：很久以前有一個雞蛋，它去茶館喝茶，然後就變成了茶葉蛋。\n保羅：什麼？小樂，你是認真的嗎？\n小樂：哎呀，保羅，我在開玩笑呢！\n保羅：那你快告訴我茶葉蛋是怎麼做的吧。\n小樂：做茶葉蛋很簡單，先煮雞蛋，然後把蛋殼輕輕敲碎，再加一些茶葉和鹽一起煮就可以了。\n保羅：好！我回家就試試。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How do you make Chinese tea eggs?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：茶叶蛋真好吃！你知道是怎么做的吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：茶葉蛋真好吃！你知道是怎麼做的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó chá yè dàn zhēn hǎo chī nǐ zhī dào shì zěn me zuò de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Tea eggs are delicious! Do you know how to make them?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：很久以前有一个鸡蛋，它去茶馆喝茶，然后就变成了茶叶蛋。",
      "traditional": "小樂：很久以前有一個雞蛋，它去茶館喝茶，然後就變成了茶葉蛋。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hěn jiǔ yǐ qián yǒu yí ge jī dàn tā qù chá guǎn hē chá rán hòu jiù biàn chéng le chá yè dàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: A long time ago, there was an egg. It went to a tea house to have tea, and then it turned into a tea egg."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：什么？小乐，你是认真的吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：什麼？小樂，你是認真的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shén me xiǎo lè nǐ shì rèn zhēn de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: What? Little Le, are you serious?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：哎呀，保罗，我在开玩笑呢！",
      "traditional": "小樂：哎呀，保羅，我在開玩笑呢！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè āi yā bǎo luó wǒ zài kāi wán xiào ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Ah, Paul, I'm kidding!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：那你快告诉我茶叶蛋是怎么做的吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：那你快告訴我茶葉蛋是怎麼做的吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà nǐ kuài gào su wǒ chá yè dàn shì zěn me zuò de ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then just quickly tell me how to make tea eggs."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：做茶叶蛋很简单，先煮鸡蛋，然后把蛋壳轻轻敲碎，",
      "traditional": "小樂：做茶葉蛋很簡單，先煮雞蛋，然後把蛋殼輕輕敲碎，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zuò chá yè dàn hěn jiǎn dān xiān zhǔ jī dàn rán hòu bǎ dàn ké qīng qīng qiāo suì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "再加一些茶叶和盐一起煮就可以了。",
      "traditional": "再加一些茶葉和鹽一起煮就可以了。",
      "pinyin": "zài jiā yì xiē chá yè hé yán yì qǐ zhǔ jiù kě yǐ le",
      "english": "Little Le: Tea eggs are very easy to make. First, boil the eggs, and then lightly crack the shell."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "After that, you add some tea leaves and salt and boil together, and it’s done."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "保罗：好！我回家就试试。",
      "traditional": "保羅：好！我回家就試試。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo wǒ huí jiā jiù shì shi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Great! I will try it when I get home."
    }
  ],
