    "sentence_translations": [
      "How do you make Chinese tea eggs?",
      "",
      "Paul: Tea eggs are delicious! Do you know how to make them?",
      "",
      "Little Le: A long time ago, there was an egg. It went to a tea house to have tea, and then it turned into a tea egg.",
      "",
      "Paul: What? Little Le, are you serious?",
      "",
      "Little Le: Ah, Paul, I'm kidding!",
      "",
      "Paul: Then just quickly tell me how to make tea eggs.",
      "",
      "Little Le: Tea eggs are very easy to make. First, boil the eggs, and then lightly crack the shell.",
      "After that, you add some tea leaves and salt and boil together, and it’s done.",
      "",
      "Paul: Great! I will try it when I get home.",
      ""
    ]
  }
